# herphase-pages is a redirect shim. THE LIVE SITE IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY.
#
# It is https://gusdigitalsolutions.com/herphase/ , served from
# lightcloud00/gusdigitalsolutions under public/herphase/. Content changes
# belong there; nothing edited in this repo will ever be seen by a visitor,
# because the first rule below 301s away from / before anything is served.
#
# This file and robots.txt are the entire purpose of the repository.
#
# Until 2026-08-23 the repo also carried a full copy of the site (index.html,
# blog/, assets/styles.css, the legal pages, llms.txt). That copy was
# unreachable AND had diverged from the real site in both directions: the hub
# had a .release-preview-card block from gusdigitalsolutions#129 that this copy
# never received, and this copy had the design-token layer from
# herphase-pages#21 that the hub never received. There is no sync script. The
# drift surfaced when a CSS-polish sweep merged here and a live probe showed the
# published stylesheet unchanged. The dead copy is gone; git history has it.
#
# To change the HerPhase site:
#   lightcloud00/gusdigitalsolutions -> public/herphase/
#   bun run verify && bun run cf:deploy -- --apply   (merging does not publish)

